\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {B.1}{\ignorespaces Daily data flow through the backtesting framework. Return history available through the current close enters the model sequence, which includes PCA, factor regression, and any custom signals. The strategy converts these outputs into target portfolio weights, while the simulator handles positions, returns, trades, and fees. The return arrow supplies the strategy with current weights after market movements, allowing it to calculate the next adjustment. The diagram shows one strategy, but several independent portfolios can use the same model outputs.\relax }}{28}{figure.caption.63}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:framework-components}{{B.1}{28}{Daily data flow through the backtesting framework. Return history available through the current close enters the model sequence, which includes PCA, factor regression, and any custom signals. The strategy converts these outputs into target portfolio weights, while the simulator handles positions, returns, trades, and fees. The return arrow supplies the strategy with current weights after market movements, allowing it to calculate the next adjustment. The diagram shows one strategy, but several independent portfolios can use the same model outputs.\relax }{figure.caption.63}{}}
